# GitHub Actions secrets (Repository → Settings → Secrets)

| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `DOKPLOY_WEBHOOK_BACKEND` | Dokploy webhook URL for backend service redeploy |
| `DOKPLOY_WEBHOOK_LANDING` | Dokploy webhook URL for landing |
| `DOKPLOY_WEBHOOK_ADMIN` | Dokploy webhook URL for admin |
| `DOKPLOY_WEBHOOK_MINI_APP` | Dokploy webhook URL for mini-app |

Payload sent on deploy: `{"image":"ghcr.io/<owner>/lead-cat-<service>:<tag>"}`
